<title>USA: CME traders say USDA Cattle-on-Feed data bearish.</title>
<headline>CME traders say USDA Cattle-on-Feed data bearish.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Mercantile Exchange traders said the U.S. Department of Agriculture's monthly Cattle-on-Feed Report was bearish for live cattle futures.</p>
<p>December live cattle futures Monday were seen opening 0.50 to 0.75 cent a lb lower based on the data.</p>
</text>
